baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 글로벌 금고 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/global-vault
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 자원 이전 — 영토 창고 → 금고 (TO_VAULT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/global-vault/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "TO_VAULT",
  "sourceTerritoryId": 1,
  "amount": 5000
}

### 자원 이전 — 금고 → 영토 창고 (FROM_VAULT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/global-vault/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "FROM_VAULT",
  "sourceTerritoryId": 1,
  "amount": 3000
}

### 자원 이전 — GP 부족 (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/global-vault/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "TO_VAULT",
  "sourceTerritoryId": 1,
  "amount": 9999999
}

### 자원 이전 — 쿨다운 중 재시도 (429)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/global-vault/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "TO_VAULT",
  "sourceTerritoryId": 1,
  "amount": 100
}
